1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
What if we are the aliens?

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:06,166
We always picture them arriving in a ship, coming down through the clouds to find us.

3
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:11,194
There is a theory that we have had it backwards, because our bodies fit this planet so badly.

4
00:00:11,514 --> 00:00:17,240
We burn in the sun, our backs give out, and we are the only animals that look at the stars and feel homesick.

5
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:25,380
It is called panspermia, and in 1973 Francis Crick, who helped discover DNA, asked whether life here was seeded on purpose.

6
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:30,499
None of that makes us aliens, since our DNA sits inside Earth's own family tree.

7
00:00:30,919 --> 00:00:35,844
But it flips the question, because the signal we keep waiting for might have been inside us all along.

8
00:00:36,394 --> 00:00:41,140
So what if twenty twenty-seven is the year somebody finally comes to take us home?
